/*
  Every Balancer V1 (BPool / ConfigurableRightsPool) pool ever deployed. V1 lived only on
  Ethereum mainnet and the BFactory was frozen long ago, so this list is a constant.

  Discovered once from `LOG_NEW_POOL` events on BFactory
  0x9424B1412450D0f8Fc2255FAf6046b98213B76Bd (from block 9562480); addresses whose
  emitting caller passes `CRPFactory.isCrp` are smart-pool share tokens, the rest are core
  BPools. Stored as one 40-hex-char blob per line to keep the file small; the extra metadata
  (symbol, name, tokens, underlying BPool) is only needed to act on a position and lives in
  `balancer/exit-ui@feat/balancer-v1-exits` -> tools/mainnet-v1-pools.json.
*/

